oïc Guerineau.<br /></span><span></span>Electroacoustic composer, sound creator, artivist and musician from\nMarseille. Compromited into sound ecology and raging against Airbnb.<span></span>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Here are three of his pieces to find out !</span></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>Panier\ndistrict soundscape</span></b><span> 12'<br />A composition based on recordings from the Panier district in\nMarseille. <br />\nA microphone interpretation of this Mediterranean emblem.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>Communications\nlost in repression</span></b><span> 5'46<br />From different places and stories emerge coherent and quite stable\nnarratives, which show and underline common repression schemes against\ncollective mobilisations.<br />\nThis piece is a mix of several phonographic works by Loïc Guerineau,\nChristopher de Laurenti and Hugo Lioret.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>Acid Rain</span></b><span> 10’<br />Sustained waterdrops in a broken cycle.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Find </span><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/loic-guerineau-874383709?ref=clipboard&amp;p=a&amp;c=1&amp;si=a2e8bb2a57a64917919d91280948fd39&amp;utm_source=clipboard&amp;utm_medium=text&amp;utm_campaign=social_sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>Loïc\nGuerineau</span></a><span> on Soundcloud and follow him !</span></p>","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.7.0","subject":"radio art;Radia;Radio Grenouille","title":"Show 0962: Carte blanche for Loïc Guerineau (Radio Grenouille)","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","publicdate":"2023-09-01 14:52:47","addeddate":"2023-09-01 14:52:47","curation":"[curator]validator@archive.org[/curator][date]20230901145556[/date][comment]checked for malware[/comment]","ppi":"300","ocr":"tesseract 5.3.0-3-g9920","ocr_parameters":"-l fra+eng+Latin","ocr_module_version":"0.0.21","ocr_autonomous":"true","ocr_detected_script":"Latin","ocr_detected_script_conf":"1.0000","ocr_detected_lang":"fr","ocr_d